197 - The King of Love My Shepherd Is
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 197
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[Bm]The [D/A]King [C/G]of [Bm]love my Shepherd [Em/B]is,
[D7/A]Whose goodness [D/A]faileth [G]never;
[D]I [C/E]nothing [G/D]lack [Bm]if Iam His,
[C]And He [D/F#]is mine [Em/B]forever.

Verse 2:
[Bm]Where [D/A]streams [C/G]of [Bm]living water [Em/B]flow
[D7/A]My ransomed [D/A]soul [G]He leadeth,
[D]And, [C/E]where [D]the verdant [Bm]pastures grow,
[C]With food [D/F#]celestial [C]feedeth.

Verse 3:
[Bm]Perverse [C/G]and [Bm]foolish, oft [D7/C]I [Em/B]strayed,
[D7/A]But yet [Bm]in [D/A]love [G]He sought me,
[D]And [C/E]on [D]His shoulder [D7/C]gently [Bm]laid,
[C]And home, [D/F#]rejoicing, [C]brought [D7/C]me.

Verse 4:
[Bm]And [D/A]so [C/G]through [Bm]all the length [D7/C]of [Em/B]days
[D7/A]Thy goodness [D/A]faileth [G]never;
[D]Good [C/E]Shepherd! [D]I [Bm]would [D7/C]sing [Bm]Thy praise
[C]Within [D/F#]Thy house [Em/B]forever.
